    {
      "id": "1.47.10",
      "label": "1.47.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "एष देशः स काकुत्स्थ महेन्द्राध्युषितः पुरा\nदितिं यत्र तपःसिद्धामेवं परिचचार सः |",
      "iast": "eṣa deśaḥ sa kākutstha mahendrāt adyuṣitaḥ purā\nditim yatra tapaḥ siddhām evam paricacāra saḥ |",
      "translation": "\"Oh, Rama of Kakutstha, this province is that one which was once presided over by Indra, and where he rendered services to that accomplished one in her asceticism, namely lady Diti.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
