    {
      "id": "1.47.14",
      "label": "1.47.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "सुचन्द्रतनयो राम धूम्राश्व इति विश्रुतः |\nधूम्राश्वतनयश्चापि सृंजयः समपद्यत",
      "iast": "sucandra tanayo rāma dhūmra aśva iti viśrutaḥ |\ndhūmrāśva tanayaḥ ca api sṛñjayaḥ samapadyata",
      "translation": "\"The son of Suchandra became famous as Dhuumraashva, and oh, Rama, Dhuumraashva derived his son named Srinjaya.",
